* Adventure Works DW2019\n(SSAS Multidimensional Cube) <<cube>>
** Measure Group:\nFact Reseller Sales <<measure>>
*** Base Measures (12) <<measure>>
**** Sales Amount
**** Total Product Cost
**** Extended Amount
**** Discount Amount
**** Tax Amt
**** Freight
**** Order Quantity
**** Unit Price
**** Unit Price Discount Pct
**** Product Standard Cost
**** Revision Number
**** Fact Reseller Sales Count
*** Calculated Measures (8) <<calculated>>
**** Gross Profit Margin\n= (Sales Amount - Total Product Cost)\n  / Sales Amount
**** AOV (Avg Order Value)\n= Sales Amount\n  / Fact Reseller Sales Count
**** Discount Ratio\n= Discount Amount / Sales Amount
**** Effective Tax Rate\n= Tax Amt / Sales Amount
**** Gross Profit Amount\n= Sales Amount - Total Product Cost
**** Net Profit Amount\n= Sales Amount - Total Product Cost\n  - Tax Amt - Freight
**** Sales Target Status
**** Freight Cost Per Item\n= Freight / Order Quantity

